<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ZEC" style="id">RRK38.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">ZEKARIA</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Kya Nabi Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc2">Zekaria</para>
  <para style="toc3">Zek</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKITABO KYA NABI</para>
  <para style="mt1">ZEKARIA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ZEC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okworekwa embaraasi ina, amahembe ana, n'abaheesi bana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 6:14">Ezr 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 12:4">Neh 12:4</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 12:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:1">Hag 2:1</ref>, <ref loc="HAG 2:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kwa munaana omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari nabi Zekaria mwene Berekia mwijukuru wa Ido, nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:2" />MUKAMA akagwerwa kubi munonga baashwenkuriimwe; <verse eid="ZEC 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 31:6">Isa 31:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:22">Yer 3:22</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:19">Mik 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:7">Mal 3:7</ref>. </char></note> n'ahabw'ekyo obagire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Mungarukire, naanye niinyija kubagarukira; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:15">2 Bus 36:15</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 36:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:8">Zab 78:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:11">Zek 7:11</ref>. </char></note> Mutaba nka baashwenkuriimwe, abu baanabi aba ira baabaire bagambira n'eiraka rihango bati: Mugarukye, murekye emitwarize yaanyu mibi, n'ebibi ebi murikukora. Kwonka baayanga kumpurira, n'obu kwakuba okuunyetaho; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 14:10">Yob 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 8:52">Yoh 8:52</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, baashwenkuriimwe barahi? Na baanabi, nimugira ngu batuuraho ebiro byona? <verse eid="ZEC 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:15">Bir 28:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:8">Isa 40:8</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:17">Tonz 2:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:31">Ezk 36:31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:6">Dan 9:6</ref>. </char></note> Beitu ebigambo byangye n'ebiragiro byangye, ebi naaragiire abairu bangye baanabi, tibirahikire ahari baashwenkuriimwe? N'ahabw'ekyo bakeeteisa nibagira bati: Nk'oku MUKAMA ow'amahe yaamaririire kutugira, nk'emitwarize yaitu n'ebi twakozire, oku biri, nikwo atugizire.<verse eid="ZEC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:7" />Aha kiro kya makumi abiri na bina omu kwezi kwa ikumi na kumwe, okwezi okurikwetwa Shebati, omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Dario, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari nabi Zekaria, mwene Berekia, mwijukuru wa Ido; nawe nikwo kugira ati: <verse eid="ZEC 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:4">Kush 6:4</ref>. </char></note> Nyekiro ku ngiire kugira nti, naareeba omushaija naagyendera aha mbaraasi erikutukura; yaayemerera ahagati y'emiti emikadasi eri omu kahanga; kandi enyima ye habaire ahariyo embaraasi ezirikutukura, ez'obugondo n'ezirikwera. <verse eid="ZEC 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:6">Kush 22:6</ref>. </char></note> Ntyo naabuuza nti: Biriya niki, mukama wangye? Maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yangarukamu ati: Naaza kukworeka amakuru gaabyo. <verse eid="ZEC 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:7">Yob 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:14">Heb 1:14</ref>. </char></note> Atyo omushaija owaabaire ayemereire omu mikadasi yaagira ati: Aba nibo MUKAMA atumire kugyendagyenda nibeetegyereza ensi. <verse eid="ZEC 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:11" />Baagarukamu maraika owaabaire ayemereire omu mikadasi, nibagira bati: Tuherize kugyendagyenda omu nsi, twagyetegyereza, twashanga ensi yoona ecureire, etuurize. <verse eid="ZEC 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 80:4">Zab 80:4</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 102:13">102:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:11">Yer 25:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:10">29:10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira ati: Ai MUKAMA ow'amahe, oryahitsya hi okutasaasira Yerusaalemu n'endembo za Yuda, ezi omazire emyaka makumi mushanju ogwereirwe kubi? <verse eid="ZEC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 6:10">Kush 6:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:11">Yer 29:11</ref>. </char></note> Maraika ogwo owaabaire naagamba naanye, MUKAMA yaamugarukamu ebigambo by'embabazi kandi ebirikuhuumuriza. <verse eid="ZEC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 2:18">Yoel 2:18</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:2">Zek 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Atyo maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yangira ati: Gamba n'eiraka rihango, noogira oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Nyine eihato ringi ahabwa Yerusaalemu na Saayuuni. <verse eid="ZEC 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 47:6">Isa 47:6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi nyine ekiniga kingi ahabw'amahanga agataine ki geetaireho; ahabw'okuba ku naagwereirwe kubi kakye Abaisraeli, ago mahanga gaababonabonesa, gaarengyesereza. <verse eid="ZEC 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 6:14">Ezr 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:39">Yer 31:39</ref>. </char></note> Nikyo MUKAMA arikugirira ati: Ngarukiire Yerusaalemu, ngiiniire embabazi; enju yangye eryagyombekwamu, kandi omugoye gw'okugyeresa guryagyeresibwa omuri Yerusaalemu; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:1">Isa 40:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:3">51:3</ref>. </char></note> Garuka ogambe n'eiraka rihango oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Endembo zangye ziryagaruka ziijure obugwa gye, bushandaare hoona, MUKAMA agarukye ahuumurize Saayuuni, atoorane Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ZEC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:11">1 Bag 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima naimutsya amaisho; ku naagire kugira nti, naareeba amahembe ana. <verse eid="ZEC 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:19" />Naabuuza maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye nti: Biriya niki? Yangarukamu ati: Biriya nigo mahembe agaataataaniise Yuda, Israeli na Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="ZEC 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:20" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaanyoreka abaheesi bana. <verse eid="ZEC 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 1:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 75:4">Zab 75:4</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 75:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Naamubuuza nti: Bariya baija kukora ki? Yangarukamu ati: Ago nigo mahembe agaataataaniise Yuda, hakabura owaimutsya omutwe, kandi abo baheesi baizire kutiinisa amahanga agaimukize amahembe gaago kurwanisa ensi ya Yuda kugitaataanisa, n'okuteera ahansi ago mahembe.<verse eid="ZEC 1:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ZEC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Maraika okutumwa kugyera Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 40:3">Ezk 40:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naimutsya amaisho; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba omuntu oine omugoye gw'okugyeresa omu ngaro ze. <verse eid="ZEC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:2" />Naamubuuza nti: Nooza hi? Yangarukamu ati: Ninza kugyera Yerusaalemu kumanya obukiika n'oburaingwa bwayo. <verse eid="ZEC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:3" />Reeba, maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yaashohora, kandi maraika ondiijo yaija kumubugana; <verse eid="ZEC 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EST 9:19">Est 9:19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:19">Isa 49:19</ref>. </char></note> yaamugira ati: Imuka ogambire oriya mutsigazi, noogira oti: Yerusaalemu eryatuurwamu, nk'oku batuura omu birorero ebitaine ngo, ahabw'abantu baamwo n'amatungo gaabo kuba bingi; <verse eid="ZEC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 125:2">Zab 125:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 4:5">Isa 4:5</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba niinye ndiba orugo rwayo rw'omuriro orugyehinguririize, kandi niinye ndiba ekitiinisa omuriyo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="ZEC 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 48:20">Isa 48:20</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:10">Ezk 5:10</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Yeimwe! Yeimwe! Nimuhungye, murugye omu nsi y'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, ahabw'okuba niinyija kubataaruura, mbaihe ei emiyaga ena y'omu iguru ereetwa. <verse eid="ZEC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:7" />Imwe batuuzi ba Babulooni 'mwe, nimuhungire Saayuuni; <verse eid="ZEC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:10">Bir 32:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 12:14">Yer 12:14</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA ow'amahe ku yaaherize kuntuma aha mahanga agaabaire nigabanyaga, kumuhaisa ekitiinisa, (ahabw'okuba obakoraho aba akozire aha mboni y'eriisho rye) <verse eid="ZEC 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:15">Isa 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 19:16">19:16</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:33">Ezk 33:33</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 39:10">39:10</ref>. </char></note> yangira ati: Reeba, ndyagatigitira omukono, ngubangire, gahindukye eminyago y'abaabaire nibagaheereza. Haza obwo muryamanya ku MUKAMA ow'amahe niwe antumire. <verse eid="ZEC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:12">Lev 26:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 37:27">Ezk 37:27</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:14">Zef 3:14</ref>, <ref loc="ZEP 3:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:3">Zek 8:3</ref>. </char></note> Iwe Saayuuni, yeshongore, oshemererwe; ahakuba reeba, niinyija, kandi ndyatuura omuriiwe ahagati; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba amahanga maingi garyayehongyera MUKAMA, babe abantu bangye; ndyaguma omuriiwe ahagati. <verse eid="ZEC 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:9">Bir 32:9</ref>. </char></note> Haza obwo oryamanya ku MUKAMA ow'amahe akuntumireho. Bwanyima MUKAMA aryahungura Yuda ebe omugabo gwe omu nsi erikwera, agarukye atoorane Yuda.<verse eid="ZEC 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 2:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="HAB 2:20">Hab 2:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe abaine omubiri mwena, mucecekye omu maisho ga MUKAMA, ahabw'okuba ayebandatwire omu butaaho bwe oburikwera.<verse eid="ZEC 2:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ZEC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Yoshua okwihwaho ebibi n'okuheebwa obushoboorozi bw'okwehikira</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 21:1">1 Bus 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 109:6">Zab 109:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 3:2">Ezr 3:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaanyoreka Yoshua omunyamurwa omukuru ayemereire omu maisho ga maraika wa MUKAMA, na Sitaane amwemereire aha rubaju rwa buryo kumutabaariza. <verse eid="ZEC 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 4:11">Amo 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:9">Yud 9</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagira Sitaane ati: Iwe Sitaane, MUKAMA akuhane! Torikumanya ogu ku ari ekicumurwa ekiihirwe omu muriro? <verse eid="ZEC 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 64:6">Isa 64:6</ref>; <ref loc="JUD 1:23">Yud 23</ref>. </char></note> Obwo Yoshua akaba ayemereire omu maisho ga maraika, ajwaire ebijwaro bisiisikaire munonga. <verse eid="ZEC 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:7">Isa 6:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:10">61:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1:19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 15:22">15:22</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Kush 7:14</ref>; <ref loc="REV 19:8">19:8</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yaagira abaamwemereire omu maisho ati: Mumujuure ebyo bijwaro bisiisikaire munonga. Kandi yaagira ati: Reeba, naakwihaho okutahikiirira kwawe, niinyija kukujweka ebijwaro birungi munonga. <verse eid="ZEC 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 29:14">Yob 29:14</ref>. </char></note> Naanye naagira nti: Bamute ekikwemba kishemeire aha mutwe. Batyo baamuta ekikwemba kishemeire aha mutwe, baamujweka ebijwaro; obwo maraika wa MUKAMA ayemereire aho.<verse eid="ZEC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:6" />Maraika wa MUKAMA yaayehanangiriza Yoshua ati: <verse eid="ZEC 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:35">Lev 8:35</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 17:9">Bir 17:9</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Ku oraagyendere omu mihanda yangye, waarinda gye ebi naakukwatsize, oryategyeka enju yangye, orinde n'ebikaari byangye; naanye ndyakuha obushoboorozi bw'okwehikira omuri aba abeemereire aha. <verse eid="ZEC 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:1">Isa 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">42:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:11">Ezk 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 6:12">Zek 6:12</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu, iwe Yoshua omunyamurwa omukuru, hurira, iwe na bagyenzi baawe abashutama omu maisho gaawe, ahabw'okuba abo bantu n'akamanyiso. Reeba, ndyareeta omuheereza wangye Itaagi. <verse eid="ZEC 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 4:10">Zek 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:6">Kush 5:6</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, aha ibaare eri ntaire omu maisho ga Yoshua, eibaare rimwe eriine embaju mushanju, ndyasharuraho ebihandiiko byaryo; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira; kandi orubanja rw'egi nsi ndyarwihaho omu izooba rimwe. <verse eid="ZEC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 3:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 4:25">1 Bag 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba buri muntu omuriimwe aryayeta mutaahi we kushutama ahansi y'omuzaabibu gwe n'ahansi y'omutiini gwe; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.<verse eid="ZEC 3:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ZEC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okworekwa ekikondo ky'etabaaza n'emizeituuni ebiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:18">Dan 8:18</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 10:9">10:9</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 10:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yaagaruka yansisiimura, nk'oku omuntu asisiimurwa omu turo; <verse eid="ZEC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:31">Kur 25:31</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 25:37">37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:12">Kush 1:12</ref>; <ref loc="REV 4:5">4:5</ref>. </char></note> yangira ati: Nooreeba ki? Naamugira nti: Nindeeba ekikondo ky'etabaaza eky'ezaabu nsha, ekiteekirweho orwabya, kandi ekiriho amatabaaza mushanju, buri emwe eine eminwa mushanju. <verse eid="ZEC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:4">Kush 11:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi aha rubaju rwakyo hariho emizeituuni ebiri, gumwe aha rubaju rwakyo rwa buryo, n'ogundi aha rwa bumosho. <verse eid="ZEC 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:4" />Naabuuza maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye nti: Ebyo amakuru gaabyo niki, Mukama wangye? <verse eid="ZEC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:5" />Maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yambuuza ati: Ebyo torikumanya amakuru gaabyo? Naagarukamu nti: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="ZEC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hos 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:1">Hag 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Eki n'ekigambo eki MUKAMA arikutuma ahari Zerubabeeli, naagira ati: Ti habw'amaani, kandi ti habw'obushoboorozi, kureka n'ahabw'Omwoyo wangye; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:4">Isa 40:4</ref>. </char></note> Iwe rushozi ruraingwa 'we, niiwe oha? Omu maisho ga Zerubabeeli oryahinduka oruhita. Kandi oryareeta eibaare ery'aha mutwe gw'agandi eririkuhamirwaho, obwo abantu nibateera akaari nibagira bati: Nirikagire omugisha! Nirikagire omugisha! <verse eid="ZEC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:8" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:10">Ezr 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:9">Zek 2:9</ref>. </char></note> Emikono ya Zerubabeeli niyo yaataireho omusingi gw'egi nju, kandi emikono ye niyo erigiheza. Haza obwo nibwo murimanya ku MUKAMA ow'amahe abantumireho. <verse eid="ZEC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 16:9">2 Bus 16:9</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:3">Hag 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 3:9">Zek 3:9</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu n'oha oragayire ebintu nibikitandika? Baryashemererwa, baareeba kariisho omu ngaro za Zerubabeeli. Ago matabaaza nigo maisho ga MUKAMA agarikubuga hoona nigareeba ebiri omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="ZEC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:11" />Bwanyima naamubuuza nti: Eriya mizeituuni ebiri eri aha rubaju rw'ekikondo ky'etabaaza orwa buryo n'orwa bumosho, amakuru gaayo niki? <verse eid="ZEC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:12" />Naagaruka naamubuuza obwa kabiri nti: Kandi gariya mataagi abiri g'emizeituuni agari aha mbaju zombi z'enshekye ibiri z'ezaabu omu amajuta garikushohorera, amakuru gaago niki? <verse eid="ZEC 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:13" />Yangarukamu ati: Torikumanya amakuru gaago? Naamugarukamu nti: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye. <verse eid="ZEC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 4:14" />Yangira ati: Ago mataagi n'abaashukirweho amajuta ababiri abeemerera aha rubaju rwa MUKAMA ow'ensi yoona.<verse eid="ZEC 4:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ZEC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okworekwa omuzingo gw'ekitabo ogurikuguruka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 36:2">Yer 36:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 36:28">28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naagaruka naimutsya amaisho; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba omuzingo gw'ekitabo niguguruka. <verse eid="ZEC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 2:9">Ezk 2:9</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 2:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Yangira ati: Nooreeba ki? Naagarukamu nti: Nindeeba omuzingo gw'ekitabo ogurikuguruka; oburaingwa bwagwo mikono makumi abiri, n'obukiika bwagwo mikono ikumi. <verse eid="ZEC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:7">Kur 20:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 20:15">15</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:27">Bir 29:27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yangira ati: Ogwo nigwo mukyeeno ogurikushohora kubuga ensi yoona; ahabw'okuba omuntu weena orikwiba okwiha hati aryamarwaho, nk'oku gurikugira, kandi weena orikurahira ebishuba aryamarwaho nk'oku gurikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 3:33">Enf 3:33</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Ndyagwohereza gutaahe omu nju y'omushuma, n'omu nju y'orikurahira eiziina ryangye naabeiha, gugume omu maju gaabo, gumarireho kimwe embaaho n'amabaare.<verse eid="ZEC 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:5" />Bwanyima maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye yaija, yangira ati: Imutsya amaisho gaawe, oreebe eki ekirikushohora, omanye oku kiri. <verse eid="ZEC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 45:11">Ezk 45:11</ref>. </char></note> Naagira nti: Ni kintu ki? Yaagira ati: Ni eefa erikushohora. Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Eki n'eky'okushiisha ekiri omu nsi yoona. <verse eid="ZEC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:7" />Kandi reeba, ekifundikizo kyayo ky'eibaati ku kyafundwirwe, naareeba omukazi agishutamimu. <verse eid="ZEC 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:8" />Maraika ogwo yaagira ati: Ogwo niwe Bubi. Yaamwigatira omuri eefa, yaagarura ekyo kifundikizo ky'eibaati ekiremeire aha minwa yaayo. <verse eid="ZEC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:9" />Naagaruka naimutsya amaisho; ku naagiire kugira nti, naareeba abakazi babiri nibaija, baine omuyaga omu mapapa gaabo; bakaba baine amapapa nk'ag'enkongoro; baakiriza eefa egyo, baagitwarira omu kaabunga. <verse eid="ZEC 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:10" />Naabuuza maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye nti: Eefa eriya nibagitwara hi? <verse eid="ZEC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 5:11" />Yangarukamu ati: Nibagitwara omu nsi ya Shinaari kugyombekyerayo enju; kandi egyo nju ku erihwa, baryata eefa egyo omu mwanya gwayo.<verse eid="ZEC 5:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ZEC 6" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okworekwa ebigaari bina, ekirunga n'Eitaagi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:1" />Kandi naagaruka naimutsya amaisho; ku naagire kugira nti, naareeba ebigaari bina nibiruga ahagati y'enshozi ibiri; ezo nshozi zikaba ziri ez'emiringa. <verse eid="ZEC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2, 3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 1:8">Zek 1:8</ref>. </char></note> Ekigaari ky'okubanza kikaba nikikururwa embaraasi zirikutukura, ekya kabiri nikikururwa ezirikwiragura; <verse eid="ZEC 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:3" />ekya kashatu nikikururwa ezirikwera, kandi ekya kana nikikururwa ez'ebihuura by'obugondo. <verse eid="ZEC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:4" />Bwanyima naabuuza maraika owaabaire naagamba naanye nti: Ebi niki, Mukama wangye? <verse eid="ZEC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 104:4">Zab 104:4</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 1:7">Heb 1:7</ref>. </char></note> Maraika yangarukamu ati: Ebi nibiija kushohora kuza ei emiyaga ena y'omu iguru ereetwa, byaheza kweyoreka omu maisho ga MUKAMA ow'ensi yoona. <verse eid="ZEC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:6" />Ekigaari ekirikukururwa embaraasi ezirikwiragura nizigyenda nizitoora omu nsi y'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho; ezirikwera nizitoora omu nsi y'oburengyerwa-izooba, ez'ebihuura by'obugondo nizitoora omu nsi y'obukiizi-bwa-buryo. <verse eid="ZEC 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:7" />Ezo mbaraasi ku zaashohoire, zaagira obwira bw'okwenda kugyenda hoona, nizeetegyereza ensi. Yaagira ati: Nimwirooko mugyendagyende omu nsi, mugyetegyereze. Zityo zaagyenda nizeetegyereza ensi. <verse eid="ZEC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:8" />Bwanyima yangambira n'eiraka rihango ati: Reeba, ziriya ezirikuza omu nsi y'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho ziikaikaniise ekiniga kyangye eki nyiniire ab'omuri egyo nsi.<verse eid="ZEC 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:9" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:18">2 Bag 25:18</ref>. </char></note> Iha omu baatwairwe omu bukwatwa Heludai, Tobiya na Yedaaya abarugire Babulooni, oze omwa Yosia mwene Zefania eri izooba. <verse eid="ZEC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:11" />Obaakye efeeza n'ezaabu, obiheeshemu ekirunga, okite aha mutwe gwa Yoshua mwene Yehozadaaki omunyamurwa omukuru, <verse eid="ZEC 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:12" />omugire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, omuntu orikwetwa Itaagi; ahabw'okuba aryakurira gye omu mwanya gwe, kandi aryayombeka hekalu ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="ZEC 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 21:5">Zab 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 110:4">110:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:27">Ezk 21:27</ref>. </char></note> Niwe aryombeka hekalu ya MUKAMA, akagira ekitiinisa ky'obugabe, akashutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe, akategyeka. Kandi aha rubaju rw'ekitebe kye ky'obugabe haryabaho omunyamurwa, bombi bagire okumanyana kw'obusingye ahagati yaabo. <verse eid="ZEC 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:14" />Ekyo kirunga kiryaguma omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, kubeera Heludai, Tobiya, Yedaaya na Yosia mwene Zefania ekiijutsyo.<verse eid="ZEC 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 6:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 30:1-3">Bir 30:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:10">Isa 60:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:9">Zek 2:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abariba bari hare baryaija, bahwere omu by'okwombeka hekalu ya MUKAMA; haza obwo muryamanya ku MUKAMA ow'amahe niwe abantumireho. Kandi ku murita omutima aha kworobera eiraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu, ebyo biryabaho.<verse eid="ZEC 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ZEC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okubagambira eby'okwesiibyakwo okw'oburyarya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:1" />Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Dario, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kikaija ahari Zekaria aha kiro kya kana ky'okwezi kwa mwenda okurikwetwa Kisileevi. <verse eid="ZEC 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 13:12">1 Sam 13:12</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:9">Mal 1:9</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo aba Beseeli bakaba batumire Sharezeeri na Regyemu-meleki n'abashaija baabo kweshengyereza MUKAMA kubagirira embabazi, <verse eid="ZEC 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:8">2 Bag 25:8</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:12">Zek 12:12</ref>. </char></note> n'okubuuza abanyamurwa b'enju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe na baanabi, bati: Tushemereire kuza omu magyenyi n'okwesiibyakwo omu kwezi kwa kataano, nk'oku tubaire nitugira omu myaka egi yoona? <verse eid="ZEC 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:4" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA ow'amahe kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:25">2 Bag 25:25</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:4">Isa 58:4</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 58:5">5</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:12">Zek 1:12</ref>. </char></note> Gambira abantu b'omuri egi nsi boona n'abanyamurwa oti: Obu mwabaire mwesiibyakwo, mukaza omu magyenyi omu kwezi kwa kataano n'okwa mushanju omuri egyo myaka makumi mushanju, obwo niinye mwabaire mwesiibizakwo? <verse eid="ZEC 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 11:20">1 Kor 11:20</ref>, <ref loc="1CO 11:21">21</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku murya, mwanywa, timweriira mukeenywera? <verse eid="ZEC 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 17:26">Yer 17:26</ref>. </char></note> Ebyo tibyo MUKAMA yaagambire naaraba omuri baanabi aba ira, obu Yerusaalemu yaabaire ekitwirwemu, ekigogyeire kandi ekyehinguririziibwe endembo zaayo, n'ensi y'obukiizi-bwa-buryo bikitwirwemu?<verse eid="ZEC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:8" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyagaruka kyaija ahari Zekaria nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:9, 10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:21">Kur 22:21</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 22:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 22:22">Enf 22:22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 5:28">Yer 5:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:12">21:12</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:8">Mik 6:8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 23:23">Mat 23:23</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Mucwe emanja z'oburyo, buri muntu agirire mwene waabo embabazi n'esaasi. <verse eid="ZEC 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:10" />Murekye kuhata abafaakazi, efuuzi, abashuuhuuki n'abooro; kandi harekye kugira n'omwe omuriimwe owaagirira omwene waabo enaama mbi omu mutima gwe. <verse eid="ZEC 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 9:29">Neh 9:29</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka baayanga kuhurira, baatunika amabega, baayereebera kuriya, amatu baagahenderamu ebiti, ngu batampurira. <verse eid="ZEC 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:16">2 Bus 36:16</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:30">Neh 9:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:19">Ezk 11:19</ref>. </char></note> Baagangaaza emitima yaabo nk'amabaare, ngu batahurira ebiragiro bya MUKAMA ow'amahe, n'ebigambo ebi yaabatumireho Omwoyo we, naaraba omuri baanabi aba ira. Nikyo ekiniga kingi kyarugiire ahari MUKAMA ow'amahe. <verse eid="ZEC 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 1:24-28">Enf 1:24-28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 11:11">Yer 11:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Nk'oku naabeetsire, bakanga kuhurira, nikwo nabo baanyetsire, nkanga kubahurira, <verse eid="ZEC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 7:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:15">Ezk 12:15</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 12:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 3:6">Zef 3:6</ref>. </char></note> nkabataataanisisa omuyaga gw'akasooroora omu mahanga goona, agu batakamanyaga. Okwo nikwo ensi ei baatsigireho yaahindukire eihamba, ekabura owaagirabamu naagyenda nari naagaruka; etyo egyo nsi erikukundwa yaahinduka eihamba.<verse eid="ZEC 7:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ZEC 8" />
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okuhanuura aha kugarurwaho kwa Yerusaalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:1" />Kandi ekigambo kya MUKAMA ow'amahe kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:2" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Nyiniire Saayuuni eihato ringi, kandi ngiriiniire nyine ekiniga kingi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:26">Isa 1:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 2:3">2:3</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ndyagaruka Saayuuni, ntuure omuri Yerusaalemu; kandi Yerusaalemu egyo eryayetwa orurembo orurikwesigwa, n'orushozi rwa MUKAMA ow'amahe rwetwe orushozi orurikwera. <verse eid="ZEC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:4" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Abagurusi n'abakaikuru baryagaruka, bashutame omu nguuto za Yerusaalemu, buri muntu naayehimbagiririza aha kibango kye ahabw'okukura munonga. <verse eid="ZEC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:5" />Kandi enguuto z'orurembo ziryaijura aboojo n'abaishiki nibazizaaniramu. <verse eid="ZEC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 118:23">Zab 118:23</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Ku kiraabe kiri eky'okutangaaza omu maisho g'abantu aba abatsigaireho omuri ebi biro, nimugira ngu kishemereire kuba eky'okutangaaza omu maisho gangye? Nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 107:3">Zab 107:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:5">Isa 43:5</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyajuna abantu bangye, mbaihe omu nsi y'oburugwa-izooba, n'omu nsi y'oburengyerwa-izooba, <verse eid="ZEC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 4:2">Yer 4:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:33">31:33</ref>. </char></note> mbareete batuure omuri Yerusaalemu; kandi baryaba abantu bangye, naanye mbe Ruhanga waabo omu mazima n'omu kuhikiirira.<verse eid="ZEC 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 5:1">Ezr 5:1</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 5:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:18">Hag 2:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Imwe abarikuhurira omu biro ebi ebigambo ebigambirwe baanabi, okwiha aha izooba eri omusingi gw'enju ya MUKAMA gwateereirweho, ngu hekalu eyombekwe, murekye kugwa emikono; <verse eid="ZEC 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:10" />ahakuba ebyo biro bitakahikire, tihaine waabaire aheebwa ebihembo ahabwe nari ahabw'enyamaishwa ye; kandi ahabw'ababisha hakaba hatariho busingye aha muntu weena owaabaire ataaha nari owaabaire ashohora; ahabw'okuba buri muntu nkamuteerana na mugyenzi we, baayangana. <verse eid="ZEC 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:11" />Kwonka hati tindikwija kugira aba bantu abatsigaireho, nk'oku naabagizire obunyakare; nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:21">Hos 2:21</ref>, <ref loc="HOS 2:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:10">Hag 1:10</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:19">2:19</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba haryabaho okubibira omu busingye n'omu kugogyera; emizaabibu eryayera ebijuma byayo, eitaka ryeze emyaka yaaryo, n'eiguru ritoonyereze orume; kandi ndyaha abo bantu abatsigaireho ebyo bintu byona, bibe ebyabo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 12:2">Kut 12:2</ref>, <ref loc="GEN 12:3">3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:28">Isa 43:28</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 65:15">65:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi imwe nju ya Yuda n'eya Israeli 'mwe, nk'oku mwabaire muri eky'okucweraho enfumu n'eky'okukyeenwa omu mahanga, nikwo ndibajuna, mukaba ab'okuhaisa abandi omugisha. Mutatiina, kureka emikono yaanyu egume.<verse eid="ZEC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:14, 15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 9:7">Bir 9:7</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 9:8">8</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 9:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:28">Yer 31:28</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:42">32:42</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'oku naamaririire kubakora kubi, obu baashwenkuriimwe bankwatsa ekiniga, nkanga kwegarukamu, <verse eid="ZEC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:15" />nikwo n'omuri ebi biro mmaririire kukora gye Yerusaalemu n'enju ya Yuda. Mutatiina; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. <verse eid="ZEC 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 15:2">Zab 15:2</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:25">Efe 4:25</ref>. </char></note> Ebi nibyo muraagume nimukora. Mugume mugambirane amazima, mucwere omu marembo gaanyu emanja z'oburyo, kandi ezirikureeta obusingye; <verse eid="ZEC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:17" />murekye kugirirana enaama mbi omu mitima yaanyu, kandi murekye kukunda endahiro z'ebishuba; ahabw'okuba ebyo byona mbyanga; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="ZEC 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:18" />Bwanyima ekigambo kya MUKAMA ow'amahe kyanyijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="ZEC 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:1">2 Bag 25:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:2">Yer 39:2</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Okwesiibyakwo okw'omu kwezi kwa kana, okw'omu kwa kataano, okw'omu kwamushanju n'okw'omu kwa ikumi kuryabeera ab'enju ya Yuda obunaku bw'okwesiima, bw'okunanuka, n'obw'amagyenyi g'okushemererwa; n'ahabw'ekyo mukunde amazima n'obusingye.<verse eid="ZEC 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:20" />Kandi oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Obunaku buryahika, amahanga gaije, nibo batuuzi b'omu ndembo nyingi; <verse eid="ZEC 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:21, 22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:11">Zek 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:2">7:2</ref>. </char></note> abatwire omu rurembo rumwe baryaza aha rundi, bagire bati: Ka tuze kweshengyereza MUKAMA kutugirira embabazi, tusherure MUKAMA ow'amahe; naanye niinyija kuzayo. <verse eid="ZEC 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:22" />Enganda nyingi n'amahanga g'amaani baryaija kusherura MUKAMA ow'amahe omuri Yerusaalemu, n'okumweshengyereza ngu abagirire embabazi. <verse eid="ZEC 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ZEC 8:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 14:25">1 Kor 14:25</ref>; <ref loc="REV 5:9">Kush 5:9</ref>. </char></note> Oku nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugamba naagira ati: Omuri ebyo biro abantu ikumi, abarikuruga omu mahanga aga buri rurimu, baryakwata omukugiro gw'ekanzu y'Omuyudaaya, bamugire bati: Ka tugyende naiwe; ahabw'okuba tuhuriire ku Ruhanga ari hamwe naimwe.<verse eid="ZEC 8:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ZEC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Saayuuni okwesiima ahabw'okwija kwa MUKAMA</para>
  <para style="s1">Ekirikuhanuurwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:1" />Ekigambo kya MUKAMA nikirwanisa ensi ya Haduraaka, kandi kiryaguma ahari Damasiko; ahabw'okuba endembo za Aramu n'eza MUKAMA, nk'oku enganda za Israeli zoona ziri eze. <verse eid="ZEC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 28:3-5">Ezk 28:3-5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi Hamasi eri aha myatano yaazo, na Tuuro na Sidoni, zoona n'eze, n'obu ziraabe ziine obwengye bwingi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:3" />Aba Tuuro beeyombekyeire ekigo kigumire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">Baarunda efeeza nk'omucuucu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:3">N'ezaabu nk'ebyondo by'omu nguuto.<verse eid="ZEC 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 26:17">Ezk 26:17</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:18">28:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka reeba, MUKAMA aryabamaraho ebi batungire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:4">Eitungo ryabo arinagye omu nyanja,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:4">Na Tuuro emarweho omuriro.<verse eid="ZEC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEP 2:4">Zef 2:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ashikelooni eryakireeba, etiine;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Na Gaaza ekireebe, egire obusaasi bwingi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Na Ekurooni yoona, ahabw'okuba ebi yaayesigire bihindukire busha.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Gaaza eryabura omugabe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:5">Na Ashikelooni ebure ab'okugituuramu;<verse eid="ZEC 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:6" />Eihanga ryebizaarwa riryatuura Ashidoodi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:6">N'amaryo g'Abafilistia ndyagamaraho.<verse eid="ZEC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 3:17">Lev 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 66:17">66:17</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:5">Zek 12:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyaiha eshagama omu kanwa kaaryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ndiihe n'ebihagaro omu maino;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Kandi naryo riryaba ekicweka ekitsigaireho ahabwa Ruhanga waitu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Ribe nk'oruganda omuri Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:7">Na Ekurooni ebe nk'Abayebusi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 10:4">Zek 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:4">12:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ndyateera orusiisira aha nju yangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ngyehinguririze nk'abarinzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Harekye kugira abaaguma nibarabaho;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Tihariho ihanga eririkuhata eririgaruka kubajuumikira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:8">Ahakuba hati nimbyereebera.<verse eid="ZEC 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yer 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:29">Mat 11:29</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:5">21:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Saayuuni, shemererwa munonga!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Naiwe Yerusaalemu, teera akaari!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Reeba, omugabe waawe naija ah'ori,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Ahikiriire kandi ari omusinguzi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Omucureezi, kandi atembire endogoya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:9">Endogoya nto, omwana gw'endogoya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 72:8">Zab 72:8</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 1:7">Hos 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:5">Mik 5:5</ref>, <ref loc="MIC 5:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Efuraimu ndyamumaraho ebigaari,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Na Yerusaalemu ngimaremu embaraasi z'orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">N'amata g'orugamba garyamarwaho,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Aragiire amahanga kugira obusingye.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Obutegyeki bwe buryaruga aha nyanja, buhikye aha ndiijo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:10">Burugye aha Mugyera, buhikye aha muheru gw'ensi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 37:24">Kut 37:24</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 24:8">Kur 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:7">Isa 42:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 51:14">51:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi naimwe, ahabw'eshagama y'endagaano ei naaragaine naimwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:11">Ndyarekura enkwatwa, nziihe omu kiina kitarimu maizi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 61:7">Isa 61:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:17">Yer 31:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Imwe mbohe z'amatsiko 'mwe, nimugarukye aha kigo kyanyu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">Eri izooba nimpamya ku ndibashumbuusha</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:12">Ebirimu ebyanyu kabiri.<verse eid="ZEC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 27:13">Ezk 27:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahakuba nkananuura Yuda nk'obuta bwangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Na Efuraimu naagigira omwambi gwabwo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Iwe Saayuuni, ndyaimutsya batabani baawe</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Kurwanisa batabani ba Bugriika,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:13">Nkugire rurara y'emanzi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 18:14">Zab 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 21:1">Isa 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima MUKAMA aryareebwa ari ahaiguru yaabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Omwambi gwe gusyokye nk'omurabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Mukama RUHANGA aryateera enzamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:14">Ahururire omu kasoroora k'obukiizi-bwa-buryo.<verse eid="ZEC 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 4:18">Lev 4:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe aryabarinda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Baryamaraho abarekyezi b'enjungu, babaribatiirire;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Baryanywa eshagama yaabo nka viinyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Baijure nk'orwabya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:15">Ebajubye nk'ey'aha nshonda z'eitambiro.<verse eid="ZEC 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:3">Isa 62:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo aryabajuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Ahabw'okuba n'obusyo bw'abantu be;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Baryayengyengyetera aha nsi ye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:16">Nk'amabaare g'omu kirunga ag'obuguzi bwingi.<verse eid="ZEC 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 9:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:8">Isa 62:8</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 62:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:12">Yer 31:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eshi biryashemera bibe birungi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">Engano ziryareetera abatsigazi kuba gye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 9:17">Kandi viinyo y'omutahe ereetere abaishiki kubengyeya.<verse eid="ZEC 9:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ZEC 10" />
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okugarura abantu be abaataataine</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 11:14">Bir 11:14</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 135:7">Zab 135:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 14:22">Yer 14:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:26">Ezk 34:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mushabe MUKAMA enjura omu biro bya katumba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Mushabe MUKAMA oreeta emirabyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Nawe aryabagwisiza enjura ey'orutoonyerera,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:1">Buri muntu amumereze obunyaatsi omu mariisizo ge.<verse eid="ZEC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 31:19">Kut 31:19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:25">Yer 23:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 34:5">Ezk 34:5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="HAB 2:18">Hab 2:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okuba zaaterafimu ni zigamba busha,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">N'abafumu nibareeba eby'ebishuba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Nibahuumuriza abantu n'ebitaine mugasho.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Nikyo abantu barikuzengyererera nk'entaama,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:2">Bakabonabonesibwa ahabw'okubura omuriisa.<verse eid="ZEC 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 34:10">Ezk 34:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:17">17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nyiniire abariisa ekiniga ekirikubuguma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">N'abeebembezi b'abantu ndyabafubira;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ow'amahe naasaasibwa obusyo bwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Niyo nju ya Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:3">Aryabagira nk'embaraasi ye y'ekitiinisa omu rugamba.<verse eid="ZEC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22">Zab 118:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:23">Isa 22:23</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omuri egyo nju ya Yuda haryarugamu eibaare ry'obuhamizo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">Omuriyo harugyemu enkondo y'eihema,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">Omuriyo harugyemu obuta bw'orugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:4">Kandi omuriyo nimwo abategyeki boona bariruga.<verse eid="ZEC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:5" />Boona hamwe baryaba nk'abarwani b'amaani omu rugamba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Baribatiiririre ababisha omu byondo by'omu nguuto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Baryarwana, ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ari hamwe nabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:5">Barimbagirize abarikugyendera aha mbaraasi.<verse eid="ZEC 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 14:1">Isa 14:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyahamya ab'enju ya Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Njune ab'enju ya Yosefu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ndyabagarura, ahabw'okuba mbainiire esaasi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Kandi baryaba nk'abu ntakacwaga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Ahabw'okuba ndi MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:6">Kandi ndyaguma mbagarukyemu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:7" />Obwo Abaefuraimu baryahinduka abarwani rugambwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">N'emitima yaabo eryashemererwa nk'abarikushemezibwa viinyo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">Kandi abaana baabo baryakireeba, bashemererwe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:7">N'emitima yaabo eyesiimire omuri MUKAMA.<verse eid="ZEC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 5:26">Isa 5:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:11">Yer 31:11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 36:10">Ezk 36:10</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 36:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabeetesa engaro, mbataaruure,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Ahabw'okuba nkabacungura;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:8">Kandi baryaba baingi nk'obunyakare.<verse eid="ZEC 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 30:1-3">Bir 30:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 6:9">Ezk 6:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu ndaabe naabataataanisiize omu mahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Kwonka baryanyijukira omu nsi za hare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:9">Baryagumaho n'abaana baabo, kandi baryagaruka.<verse eid="ZEC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:11">Isa 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:20">49:20</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 11:11">Hos 11:11</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:14">Mik 7:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabagarura owaabo, mbaihe omu nsi ya Misri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Mbataaruure, mbaihe n'omuri Asiria,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Mbahitsye omu nsi ya Gileadi na Lebanooni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:10">Okuhitsya obu barifundamu.<verse eid="ZEC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 11:15">Isa 11:15</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 30:13">Ezk 30:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Baryaraba omu nyanja y'okubonabona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Kandi ebingonzi by'enyanja biryateerwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Hoona ahu amaizi maingi ga Nailo gari, hoome.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">Amaryo ga Asiria garyacureezibwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:11">N'enkoni y'obugabe bwa Misri eryarugiraho kimwe.<verse eid="ZEC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 10:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 4:5">Mik 4:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ndyabahamiza omuri MUKAMA,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 10:12">Nabo beesiimire omu iziina</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ZEC 10:12">rye; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira.<verse eid="ZEC 10:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ZEC 11" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1, 2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 2:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe Lebanooni, igura amarembo gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:1">Omuriro gumareho emyereezi yaawe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:2" />Iwe muberooshi 'we, borooga, ahabw'okuba omwereezi gugwire,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Kandi ebiti birungi munonga bicwekyereziibwe!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Imwe myela ya Bashani 'mwe, nimuboroogye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:2">Ahabw'okuba ekibira ekikwataine kitemirwe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 25:34">Yer 25:34</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hurira okuborooga kw'abariisa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Ahabw'okuba ekitiinisa kyabo kibaihirweho!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Hurira okutsinda kw'entare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:3">Ahabw'okuba amaryo ga Yorudani gamazirweho!<verse eid="ZEC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Zekaria okworekwa enkoni ibiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:4" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye agizire ati: Riisa obusyo bw'okubaagwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:3">Ezk 34:3</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 12:8">Hos 12:8</ref>. </char></note> Abarikuzigura nibaziita, haza bagira ngu tibaine rubanja; n'abarikuzitunda nibagira bati: MUKAMA asiimwe, ahabw'okuba twaba abatungi; kandi abariisa baazo tibarikuzigirira saasi. <verse eid="ZEC 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 13:14">Yer 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA naagira ati: Tinkigaruka kugirira saasi abatwire omuri egi nsi. Reeba, ndyabahayo, buri muntu agwe omu mikono y'omuriisa we, kandi buri muntu omu mikono y'omugabe we; abo bariisa baryasingyera ensi, kandi tiinyine u ndiiha omu mikono yaabo.<verse eid="ZEC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:7" />Ntyo naaba omuriisa w'obusyo bw'entaama z'okubaagwa. Naakwata enkoni ibiri, emwe naagyeta Mbabazi, endiijo naagyeta Bumwe; ntyo naariisa obusyo. <verse eid="ZEC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:8" />Omu kwezi kumwe naacwekyereza abariisa bashatu; bwanyima zandusya, kandi nazo zantamwa. <verse eid="ZEC 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 15:2">Yer 15:2</ref>. </char></note> Naanye nikwo kugira nti: Tindibariisa. Ow'okufa afe; ow'okucwekyerezibwa acwekyerezibwe; kandi abaritsigaraho baryane. <verse eid="ZEC 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:10" />Bwanyima naakwata enkoni yangye Mbabazi, naagihenda, niinyita endagaano ei naaragaine n'amahanga goona. <verse eid="ZEC 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:11" />Eryo izooba egyo ndagaano yaitwa, n'abashuubuzi b'entaama, abaabaire bampangire amaisho, baamanya ku kiri ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="ZEC 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:32">Kur 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:15">Mat 26:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 27:9">27:9</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 27:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima naabagira nti: Ku muraabe nimukisiima, mumpe ebihembo byangye; nari ku muraabe mutarikukisiima, murereere. Batyo baapima shekeli z'efeeza makumi ashatu kuba ebihembo byangye. <verse eid="ZEC 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:13" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: Binagye omu ibiikiro, nibyo bihembo ebi bansiimiire. Ntyo naatwara shekeli ezo z'efeeza makumi ashatu, naazinaga omu ibiikiro eriri omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="ZEC 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:14" />Bwanyima naahenda enkoni yangye ya kabiri erikwetwa Bumwe, niinyita obuzaare bwa Yuda na Israeli.<verse eid="ZEC 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:15" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yangira ati: Garuka okwate ebintu by'omuriisa, omuriisa otaine mugasho; <verse eid="ZEC 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 34:3">Ezk 34:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 34:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:13">Yoh 10:13</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba reeba, ninyiija kwimutsya omuriisa omu nsi, otarikweta ha ntaama ezibuzire, nari okusherura ezirazire, nari okubunga ezihendekire, n'obu kwakuba okuriisa ezihuriire, kureka orikwija kushonshomera enyama z'ezigomokire, akaguguna n'ebyara byazo.<verse eid="ZEC 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 11:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 23:1">Yer 23:1</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:12">Yoh 10:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Aryakareeba, ogwo muriisa wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Orikutsigaho obusyo!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Rurara eryamutema omukono, n'eriisho rya buryo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">Omukono gwe guryayoma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 11:17">N'eriisho rye rya buryo rifeere kimwe!<verse eid="ZEC 11:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ZEC 12" />
  <para style="s1">Yuda okugaruka kugira amaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:5">Isa 42:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:13">48:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eki n'ekigambo kya MUKAMA ekyahanwirwe ahari Israeli. MUKAMA owaabambire eiguru, akataho emisingi y'ensi, kandi akahangira omwoyo omu muntu, naagira ati: <verse eid="ZEC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 51:17">Isa 51:17</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 51:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 51:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:14">Zek 14:14</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kuhindura Yerusaalemu ekikopo ky'okugwereranisa amahanga goona agagyehinguririize, kandi kigwereranise na Yuda, Yerusaalemu yaaba neegotwa. <verse eid="ZEC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:2">Zek 14:2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:44">Mat 21:44</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba Yerusaalemu egyo ndyagihindura eibaare eririkurema amahanga goona; abaririkiriza boona baryashaasha munonga. Amahanga goona ag'omu nsi garyayeteerana kugirwanisa. <verse eid="ZEC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:28">Bir 28:28</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 76:6">Zab 76:6</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA naagira ati: Ndyaitsa buri mbaraasi yoona obwoba, n'ogitembire weena mmugwise eiraro. Kwonka enju ya Yuda ndyagigumyaho amaisho, kandi embaraasi z'amahanga zoona ndyazihumya. <verse eid="ZEC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:5" />Bwanyima enganda za Yuda ziryagira omu mitima yaazo ziti: Abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baine amaani agu barikuheebwa MUKAMA ow'amahe Ruhanga waabo.<verse eid="ZEC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 5:14">Yer 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:4">Zek 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 14:10">14:10</ref>, <ref loc="ZEC 14:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba enganda za Yuda ndyazigira nk'orugusyo orurikubugumwaho omuriro ahagati y'enku, nari nk'enkanza erikubugumira omu biba by'engano; ziryamaraho amahanga goona agaziri aha rubaju rwa buryo n'orwa bumosho; haza obwo Yerusaalemu eryaba neekituurwamu, nk'oku yaabaire eri.<verse eid="ZEC 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:7" />Kandi MUKAMA aryabanza kuha amahema ga Yuda obusinguzi, ngu ekitiinisa ky'enju ya Daudi n'eky'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu kirekye kukira ekya Yuda. <verse eid="ZEC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 19:27">2 Sam 19:27</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:22">Isa 60:22</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba MUKAMA aryarinda abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu, abataine maani omuribo babe nka Daudi, n'enju ya Daudi ebe nka Ruhanga, nka maraika wa MUKAMA obeebembeire. <verse eid="ZEC 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 14:3">Zek 14:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eryo izooba ndyayehayo kucwekyereza amahanga goona agateera Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="ZEC 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abaisraeli okwefuuza ahabw'okwita Kristo n'okweteisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 6:26">Yer 6:26</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:9">31:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 50:5">50:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:37">Yoh 19:37</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Kush 1:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ndyashuka aha nju ya Daudi n'aha batwire Yerusaalemu omwoyo gw'embabazi n'okweshengyereza; ku barireeba ou baacumitsire, baryamucurira, nk'omwe nyamunegyere, bamuririre munonga, nk'oku omuntu aririra omwana we w'omujigaijo. <verse eid="ZEC 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:22">2 Bus 35:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 35:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba omuri Yerusaalemu haryabamu okucura kwingi okurikwingana n'oku baacuriire Hadadi-rimoni omu ruhita rwa Megido. <verse eid="ZEC 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:14">2 Sam 5:14</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 7:3">Zek 7:3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:31">Luk 3:31</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ensi eryacura, buri ruganda rucure okwarwo, oruganda rw'enju ya Daudi okwarwo n'abakazi baabo okwabo; oruganda rw'enju ya Nasani okwarwo, n'abakazi baabo okwabo; <verse eid="ZEC 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 3:18">Kub 3:18</ref>. </char></note> oruganda rw'enju ya Leevi okwarwo n'abakazi baabo okwabo; oruganda rw'aba Shimei okwarwo n'abakazi baabo okwabo; <verse eid="ZEC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 12:14" />kandi n'enganda zoona eziritsigaraho, buri ruganda okwarwo n'abakazi baabo okwabo.<verse eid="ZEC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ZEC 13" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okuteerwa kw'Omuriisa wa Mukama, niwe Kristo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 36:25">Ezk 36:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba ab'enju ya Daudi n'abatuuzi ba Yerusaalemu baryaigurirwa enshuro y'okuboozyaho ebibi n'oburofa.<verse eid="ZEC 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:2" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:13">Kur 23:13</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:13">Mik 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 10:2">Zek 10:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ow'amahe naagira ati: Eryo izooba ndyamariraho kimwe omu nsi amaziina g'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa, birekye kwijukwa obundi; kandi ndyaiha omu nsi baanabi n'omwoyo ogutashemeire. <verse eid="ZEC 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 13:1-11">Bir 13:1-11</ref>. </char></note> Ku harigira owaagaruka kuba nabi, ishe na nyina abaamuzaire baryamugira bati: Tori w'okugumaho; ahabw'okuba noohanuura ebishuba omu iziina rya MUKAMA; kandi ishe na nyina abaamuzaire, ku ariba naahanuura, baryamuteera eicumu, rimwogyemu. <verse eid="ZEC 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2 Bag 1:8</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 3:7">Mik 3:7</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba buri nabi, ku ariba naahanuura, aryakwatwa enshoni ahabw'ebi ayorekirwe; tarijwara kijwaro ky'ebyoya kubeiha abantu, <verse eid="ZEC 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:14">Amo 7:14</ref>. </char></note> kureka aryagira ati: Tindi nabi, ndi omuhingi; ahabw'okuba okwiha omu buto bwangye eitaka rituura riri eitungo ryangye. <verse eid="ZEC 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:6" />Kandi ku harigira owaamubuuza ati: Obwo buhuta bw'omu ngaro zaawe bukaruga hi? Aryagarukamu ati: obuhuta obu nkabuhutaarizibwa omu nju ya banywani bangye.<verse eid="ZEC 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:11">Isa 40:11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 26:31">Mat 26:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Iwe rurara 'we, sisiimuka, orwane n'omuriisa wangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">Mugyenzi wangye onyemerera aha rubaju;</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ZEC 13:7">nikwo MUKAMA ow'amahe arikugira.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">Teera omuriisa, entaama zitaataane,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:7">Kandi abaana baazo ndyabateeza omukono gwangye.<verse eid="ZEC 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:8" />MUKAMA naagira ati: Omuri egyo nsi yoona</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">Ebicweka bibiri bya kashatu biryamarwaho, bicwekyerere;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:8">Kwonka kimwe kya kashatu kiryatsigaraho kihuriire.<verse eid="ZEC 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 13:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 50:15">Zab 50:15</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 48:10">Isa 48:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 11:20">Ezk 11:20</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:2">Mal 3:2</ref>, <ref loc="MAL 3:3">3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi ekyo kicweka kya kashatu ndyakirabya omu muriro,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mbashemeze nk'oku bashemeza efeeza,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Mbagyeze nk'oku bagyeza ezaabu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Baryatakira eiziina ryangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Naanye mbagarukyemu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Kandi ndyagira nti: Aba n'abantu bangye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ZEC 13:9">Nabo bagire bati: MUKAMA niwe Ruhanga waitu.<verse eid="ZEC 13:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ZEC 14" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'okugaruka kwa MUKAMA waitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOL 1:15">Yoel 1:15</ref>. </char>
    </note> Reeba, ekiro kya MUKAMA nikiija, obu omunyago ogu orinyagwa guribaganirwa omuriiwe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:16">Isa 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 5:11">Tonz 5:11</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:2">Yoel 3:2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:24">Luk 21:24</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ndyateeranira hamwe amahanga goona, gateere Yerusaalemu, kandi orurembo ruryakwatwa, amaju ganyagwe, n'abakazi bahambwe. Ekicweka ky'ab'omu rurembo kiryatwarwa omu bukwatwa, kwonka abarirokokaho tibarimarwamu. <verse eid="ZEC 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:3" />Obwo MUKAMA aryahurura, arwane n'ago mahanga, nk'oku arwana aha izooba ry'orugamba. <verse eid="ZEC 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 11:23">Ezk 11:23</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba aryayemerera aha kibungo kya Zeituuni ekishungaine na Yerusaalemu aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba; bwanyima ekyo kibungo kya Zeituuni kiryashatukamu kabiri okuruga aha rubaju rw'oburugwa-izooba, hagire oruhanga ruhango munonga, ekicweka kimwe ky'ekyo kibungo kigwe aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, n'ekindi aha rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo. <verse eid="ZEC 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:1">Amo 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:27">Mat 16:27</ref>; <ref loc="1TH 3:13">1 Tes 3:13</ref>. </char></note> Kandi muryahunga, murabe omu ruhanga rw'ahagati y'ebibungo byangye; ahabw'okuba orwo ruhanga rw'omu bibungo ruryahika Azeli; mutyo muhungye, nk'oku mwahungire omutsitsa ogwabaireho omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda. Bwanyima MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe arayija hamwe n'abarikwera be boona.<verse eid="ZEC 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:6" />Eryo izooba omushana tigurijwa, kandi tiharigira kibunda, <verse eid="ZEC 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:36">Mat 24:36</ref>; <ref loc="REV 21:25">Kush 21:25</ref>. </char></note> kureka riryaba eizooba rimwe eririkumanywa MUKAMA; tiburiba nyomushana, kandi tiburiba nyekiro, ahakuba n'omu mwabazyo omushana guryajwa.<verse eid="ZEC 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZK 47:1">Ezk 47:1</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:20">Yoel 2:20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:10">Yoh 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:1">Kush 22:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba amaizi g'amagara garyahimintika nigaruga omuri Yerusaalemu, ekicweka kyago kize omu nyanja y'oburugwa-izooba, n'ekindi kize omu nyanja y'oburengyerwa-izooba. Biryaba bityo omu kyanda n'omuri katumba. <verse eid="ZEC 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 47:7">Zab 47:7</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 1:14">Mal 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 4:5">Efe 4:5</ref>, <ref loc="EPH 4:6">6</ref>. </char></note> Kandi MUKAMA aryaba omugabe orikutegyeka ensi yoona; eryo izooba MUKAMA aryaba omwe, n'eiziina rye ribe rimwe.<verse eid="ZEC 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:10" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 2:2">Isa 2:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 40:4">40:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:38">Yer 31:38</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:13">37:13</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:4">Zek 2:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:6">12:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ensi yoona, okuruga Geeba okuhika Rimoni aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo orwa Yerusaalemu, eryaba oruhita; kwonka Yerusaalemu eryaguma etunguukire eri omu mwanya gwayo, okuruga aha Irembo rya Benyamiini okuhika aha mwanya gw'eirembo ry'okubanza aha Irembo ry'Akeekubo, n'okuruga aha munaara gwa Hananeeli okuhika aha manyuukiro ga viinyo ag'omugabe. <verse eid="ZEC 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 23:6">Yer 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="REV 22:3">Kush 22:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eryatuurwamu; ahakuba haryaba hatakiriho mukyeeno; aba Yerusaalemu baryatuura buhooro.<verse eid="ZEC 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:12" />Kandi eki nikyo kibonaboneso eki MUKAMA ariteeza amahanga goona agarirwanisa Yerusaalemu; embiri yaabo eryajunda bakyemereire, amaisho gajundire omu binonko byago, n'endimi zibajundire omu kanwa. <verse eid="ZEC 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 14:20">1 Sam 14:20</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 2:22">Hag 2:22</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba baryakwatwa obwoba bwingi oburikuruga ahari MUKAMA, buri muntu akwatane na mugyenzi we, babangirane entomi; <verse eid="ZEC 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 39:10">Ezk 39:10</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:2">Zek 12:2</ref>. </char></note> nangwa na Yuda eryarwanisa Yerusaalemu. Kandi obutungi bw'amahanga goona agagyehinguriririize buryateeranirwa hamwe, ezaabu, efeeza n'ebijwaro bingi munonga. <verse eid="ZEC 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:15" />Kandi ekibonaboneso nk'ekyo kiryahika aha mbaraasi, enyumbu, engamira, endogoya n'ahari ibara nyamaishwa eriba eri omu nsiisira zaabo.<verse eid="ZEC 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 23:34">Lev 23:34</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 23:39-43">39-43</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 8:21">Zek 8:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omuntu weena orihonoka aha mahanga goona agariba gaizire kurwanisa Yerusaalemu, aryaguma nainamuka buri mwaka kuramya Omugabe, MUKAMA ow'amahe, n'okwijuka obugyenyi bw'ensiisira. <verse eid="ZEC 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:12">Isa 60:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi oruganda rwona orw'omu nsi, ku ruriba rutainamukire Yerusaalemu kuramya Omugabe, MUKAMA ow'amahe, owaabo teriguubwa njura. <verse eid="ZEC 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:18" />Kandi oruganda rwa Misri ku ruriba rutainamukire kweyoreka, baryahikwaho ekyo kibonaboneso ki MUKAMA ata aha mahanga aganga kwinamuka kwijuka obugyenyi bw'ensiisira. <verse eid="ZEC 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:19" />Ekyo nikyo kiriba ekifubiro kya Misri n'eky'amahanga goona agatainamuka kwijuka bugyenyi bw'ensiisira.<verse eid="ZEC 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 28:36">Kur 28:36</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 4:13">Mik 4:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eryo izooba emirebe y'embaraasi eryahandiikwaho ebigambo ebi, Ekyereziibwe MUKAMA. N'enyungu eziri omu nju ya MUKAMA ziryaba nk'enyabya eziri omu maisho g'eitambiro. <verse eid="ZEC 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ZEC 14:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:9">Ezk 44:9</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:17">Yoel 3:17</ref>. </char></note> Kandi buri nyungu yoona ey'omuri Yerusaalemu n'ey'omuri Yuda eryaba eyereziibwe MUKAMA ow'amahe, boona abarikutamba baije batwareho zimwe kuziteekamu enyama z'ebitambo. Kandi eryo izooba tiharibaho Munyakanaani omu nju ya MUKAMA ow'amahe obundi.<verse eid="ZEC 14:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ZEC 14" />
</usx>